    <string name="demo_scroll_text">Lesi siqephu esithulisiwe sinikeza okuqukethwe okwanele ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuthi ikhasi liyagoqa kuyilapho izilawuli ezintantayo zihlala ziqinile.\n\nIsigaba sesibili senza ukugoqwa komugqa, ukukala kombhalo, nesikhala kubonakale kumafasitela ahlangene nanwetshiwe.\n\nIsigaba sesithathu sinweba ikhasi ngale kwembobo yokubuka yokuqala ngaphandle kokwethula enye indawo ebonakalayo.\n\nIndima yesine isiza ukuqinisekisa ukuthi ukuskrola kuhlala kushelela ngaphansi kwesihloko esintantayo nezilawuli zesenzo.\n\nIsigaba sesihlanu sigcina isibonelo singathathi hlangothi ngakho ukunaka kuhlala kuyingxenye ekhonjiswayo njengamanje.\n\nIsigaba sesithupha sinikeza ibanga elengeziwe lokuhlola ukubonakala kwebha yesihloko egxilile.\n\nIsigaba sesikhombisa siqinisekisa ukuthi okuqukethwe okude kuhlala kufundwa namasayizi ombhalo amakhulu okufinyeleleka.\n\nIsigaba sesishiyagalombili senza imvume yokuzulazula engezansi ibe lula ukuyihlola eduze nokuphela kwekhasi.\n\nIsigaba sesishiyagalolunye sihlola ukuthi isikhala sihlala singashintshile ngemva kwebhulokhi ende eqhubekayo yokuqukethwe.\n\nIsigaba seshumi nesokugcina siqinisekisa ukuthi konke okuqukethwe kuhlala kufinyeleleka ngenhla kokuzulazula namasethi esistimu.</string>
